      <rules>
        <rule name="Collector of Ancient Treasures" id="afd1-c723-ab88-2714" hidden="false" page="159" publicationId="3ae4-9ad8-pubN65739">
          <description>A Corsair Prince with this trait may select any one item from any of the following lists, paying the noted point cost:

*     Artefacts of Cruelty (Codex: Dark Eldar)
*     Remnants of Glory (Codex: Craftworlds)
*     Enigmas of the Black Library (Codex: Harlequins)

Any other character model chosen as part of the same Detachment as a Corsair Prince with this trait may make any one weapon which they are equipped with Master-crafted for +10 points.</description>
        </rule>
