      <rules>
        <rule name="Tyrant" id="e271-29da-0085-12b2" hidden="false" page="162" publicationId="3ae4-9ad8-pubN65739">
          <description>A Corsair Baron must be assigned to a friendly Troops or Elites unit chosen from the Eldar Corsairs army list at the start of the game and may not leave this unit during play. If using the Corsair Raiders Force Organization Chart, a Corsair Baron must be assigned to a unit chosen from the same Coterie.

No more than one Corsair Baron may be assigned to any single unit, and a Cloud Dancer Baron may only be assigned to a Cloud Dancer unit.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
